<title>THAILAND: Ban Chang third quarter loss widens.</title>
<headline>Ban Chang third quarter loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed consolidated financial results for the third quarter ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	  1.14	 vs  loss    0.63</p>
<p>    Net	   loss	323.90	 vs  loss  120.23</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	  2.09	 vs  loss    1.27</p>
<p>    Net	   loss	596.99	 vs  loss  241.78</p>
<p>NOTE: Ban Chang Group Plc is a property developer</p>
<p>($1 = 25 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newroom (662) 652-0642</p>
